{
  "title": "Fleet — lans-h.cc",
  "uid": "lansh-fleet",
  "tags": [
    "platform",
    "observability"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "cluster",
        "label": "Cluster",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(up, cluster)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Fleet overview / 機隊總覽",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Scrape targets — 0 means the collector cannot reach it",
      "description": "up{} per job. A target at 0 is a collection failure, not necessarily a dead workload.\n\nup{} 每個 job 一列。顯示 0 代表採集不到,不一定是該 workload 掛了。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 9,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "up{cluster=~\"$cluster\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} {{namespace}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Host CPU used",
      "description": "1 - avg(idle) across every core, so it is genuinely used/total for the whole 2-OCPU machine — not just the container sum, which misses k3s, containerd and the kernel.\n\n對全部核心取 1 - avg(idle),所以這是整台 2 OCPU 機器真正的 已使用/總量 —— 不是容器加總,那會漏掉 k3s、containerd 和 kernel。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 9,
        "y": 1
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "1 - avg(rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\", mode=\"idle\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "CPU"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.6
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.85
              }
            ]
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Host memory used",
      "description": "1 - (MemAvailable / MemTotal) on a 12 GB machine. The host figure, not the sum of containers — they never match, because kernel, page cache, k3s and containerd live outside every container.\n\n12 GB 機器上的 1 - (MemAvailable / MemTotal)。這是主機數字不是容器加總,兩者永遠對不起來 —— kernel、page cache、k3s、containerd 都不在任何容器裡。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 14,
        "y": 1
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "1 - (node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\"} / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\"})",
          "legendFormat": "RAM"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.75
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.9
              }
            ]
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Load per core (1m)",
      "description": "node_load1 divided by the core count, so 1.0 means the run queue exactly matches the CPUs available. Dividing makes it comparable across machines of different sizes.\n\nThe division is `on(instance) group_left()` on purpose. A bare `/ count(...)` returns a vector with NO labels, and PromQL will not match a labelled vector against an unlabelled one — the panel renders 'No data' with no error. Matching on `instance` also keeps it correct once there is more than one node.\n\nnode_load1 除以核心數,1.0 代表 run queue 剛好等於可用的 CPU 數;除過之後不同大小的機器才能互相比較。\n\n除法刻意寫成 `on(instance) group_left()`。直接 `/ count(...)` 得到的是一個**沒有 label** 的向量,而 PromQL 不會把有 label 的向量跟沒 label 的配對 —— panel 會顯示 No data 且不報錯。用 instance 配對也讓它在多節點時仍然正確。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 19,
        "y": 1
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "node_load1{cluster=~\"$cluster\"}\n  / on(instance) group_left()\n    count by (instance) (node_cpu_seconds_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\", mode=\"idle\"})",
          "legendFormat": "load/core"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Used / total — every bounded resource on one scale",
      "description": "Each bar is a resource divided by its own ceiling, so they are directly comparable: CPU and RAM against the machine, the three filesystems against their volumes, the PVC against its capacity, each observability pod against its memory limit, and Postgres connections against max_connections.\n\nThings with no meaningful ceiling are deliberately absent — database size, image store bytes and log bytes are bounded only by the filesystem they sit on, which is already a bar here.\n\n每一條都是某個資源除以它自己的上限,所以可以直接互相比較:CPU 與 RAM 對整台機器、三個 filesystem 對各自的卷、PVC 對其容量、每個 observability pod 對其 memory limit、Postgres 連線數對 max_connections。\n\n沒有有意義上限的東西刻意不放:資料庫大小、image store、log 大小,它們的上限就是所在的filesystem,而那已經是這裡的一條了。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "1 - avg(rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\", mode=\"idle\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "CPU (host)",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "1 - (node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\"} / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\"})",
          "legendFormat": "RAM (host)",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "1 - (node_filesystem_avail_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\", mountpoint=~\"/|/var/lib/rancher|/var/lib/containers\"} / node_filesystem_size_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\", mountpoint=~\"/|/var/lib/rancher|/var/lib/containers\"})",
          "legendFormat": "fs {{mountpoint}}",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "1 - (kubelet_volume_stats_available_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\"} / kubelet_volume_stats_capacity_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\"})",
          "legendFormat": "pvc {{persistentvolumeclaim}}",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "E",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max by (pod) (\n  sum by (pod, container) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\", namespace=\"observability\", container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\"})\n  / on(pod, container) group_left()\n  sum by (pod, container) (container_spec_memory_limit_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\", namespace=\"observability\", container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\"})\n)",
          "legendFormat": "mem/limit {{pod}}",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "F",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(pg_stat_database_numbackends{cluster=~\"$cluster\"}) / max(pg_settings_max_connections{cluster=~\"$cluster\"})",
          "legendFormat": "postgres connections",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "minVizWidth": 8,
        "minVizHeight": 16,
        "valueMode": "color"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.75
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.85
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Per-app / 各 app",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU by namespace (cores)",
      "description": "namespace == app, because every app has its own. No per-app instrumentation needed.\n\nnamespace 就是 app —— 每個 app 各有自己的 namespace,所以不需要額外埋點。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (namespace) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\", container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 4,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memory by namespace (working set)",
      "description": "observability is expected to be the largest here — see README and pending.md 2.8. That is a known open item, not a misreading.\n\nobservability 目前預期是最大的一條 —— 見 README 與 pending.md 2.8。那是已知的未結案項目,不是看錯。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 15
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (namespace) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\", container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 35,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Disk / 磁碟",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Filesystem used % — ALL THREE mountpoints",
      "description": "used / total, as 1 - (avail / size). `avail` excludes the root-reserved blocks, so this reads slightly fuller than df's own percentage — the conservative direction for something you alert on.\n\n/var/lib/rancher (containerd) and /var/lib/containers (podman) are on their own volumes since docs/runbook-storage.md. Either filling up is INVISIBLE in / — watching / alone would stay green through a full image store.\n\n已使用 / 總量,算法是 1 - (avail / size)。avail 不含 root 保留區塊,所以這個數字比 df 顯示的百分比略高一點 —— 對要拿來告警的東西而言,偏保守的方向是對的。\n\n那兩個目錄已拆成獨立卷,其中任一塞爆在 / 上完全看不出來。只看 / 的告警會在 image store 爆滿時一路顯示正常。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "1 - (node_filesystem_avail_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\", mountpoint=~\"/|/var/lib/rancher|/var/lib/containers\"} / node_filesystem_size_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\", mountpoint=~\"/|/var/lib/rancher|/var/lib/containers\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{mountpoint}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 1,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "dashed"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.75
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.85
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Filesystem used / total (bytes)",
      "description": "The same three mountpoints in absolute bytes, because a percentage hides scale: 85% of the 200 GB boot volume and 85% of a small image volume are very different amounts of work to fix.\n\n同樣三個掛載點的絕對位元組數。百分比會藏住尺度:200 GB 開機卷的 85% 和一顆小卷的 85%,要處理的工作量差很多。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 25
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "node_filesystem_size_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\", mountpoint=~\"/|/var/lib/rancher|/var/lib/containers\"} - node_filesystem_avail_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\", mountpoint=~\"/|/var/lib/rancher|/var/lib/containers\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{mountpoint}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "minVizWidth": 8,
        "minVizHeight": 16
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Image store on disk — should be a SAWTOOTH",
      "description": "prune-images.timer runs daily at 03:00 and prunes both stores. A daily drop then regrowth as deploys land is healthy. A FLAT LINE means the timer is not firing — that is what this metric exists to catch.\n\nprune-images.timer 每日 03:00 清兩個 store。每日下降、隨部署回升是正常的。一條平線代表 timer 沒在跑 —— 這正是這個指標存在的意義。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 25
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "image_store_disk_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{store}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Pod container logs, total",
      "description": "Written by the host systemd timer into node-exporter's textfile collector — NOT a Kubernetes metric. If this flatlines while deploys continue, the timer stopped.\n\n由 host 上的 systemd timer 寫進 node-exporter 的 textfile collector,不是 Kubernetes 指標。若持續部署但這條變平,就是 timer 停了。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 34
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "pod_log_total_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\"}",
          "legendFormat": "total"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
